            "text": "Aquí tienes la consulta SQL para BigQuery que calcula la fecha media y los percentiles 25, 50 y 75 de las fechas de finalización de los períodos de observación.\n\n```sql\nSELECT\n  DATE_FROM_UNIX_DATE(CAST(AVG(UNIX_DATE(observation_period_end_date)) AS INT64)) AS mean_observation_period_end_date,\n  DATE_FROM_UNIX_DATE(CAST(PERCENTILE_CONT(UNIX_DATE(observation_period_end_date), 0.25) AS INT64)) AS p25_observation_period_end_date,\n  DATE_FROM_UNIX_DATE(CAST(PERCENTILE_CONT(UNIX_DATE(observation_period_end_date), 0.50) AS INT64)) AS p50_observation_period_end_date,\n  DATE_FROM_UNIX_DATE(CAST(PERCENTILE_CONT(UNIX_DATE(observation_period_end_date), 0.75) AS INT64)) AS p75_observation_period_end_date\nFROM\n  `observation_period`\n```\n",
